{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/19/1144410/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新曲MVのことを少し書こうかと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/19/1144410/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーが口を揃えて言うのは\nこの撮影は今までで1番じゃないかな！\nってぐらいに楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/19/1144410/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/19/1144410/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのぐらい朝からずっと楽しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/19/1144410/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この写真を見たら伝わるかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/19/1144410/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/19/1144410/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影シーンの確認する時もみんなの表情とかが面白くて"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/19/1144410/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな感じ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/19/1144410/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/19/1144410/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しそうでしょ？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/19/1144410/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/19/1144410/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後のシーンが殴り合いの喧嘩なんですけど\n胸ぐら掴んで喧嘩なんて生きててそうそうないですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そーゆーのがなんだか楽しくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゅんなが隣にいたのでじゅんなと喧嘩したんですけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゅんなはやっぱりめっちゃ強くて..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/19/1144410/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"胸ぐら掴んでめっちゃ揺らしてきて眼鏡がアニメみたいに斜めになった状態で喧嘩しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/19/1144410/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"睨み合う時もほんとキスしちゃうってお互い本気で思ったぐらい近かくで睨み合いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/19/1144410/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"喧嘩のシーンは何度もメンバーを見て笑いそうになりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/19/1144410/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/19/1144410/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はしゃぎ過ぎて後ろのあの美女に被ってしまった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/19/1144410/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さてこの美女は誰でしょーか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/19/1144410/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/19/1144410/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"bye"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/19/1144410/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/19/1144410/0015.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}